<main class="main"><div class="main__inner"><div class="module-page">
<header class="module-page__header"><div><span class="module-eyebrow">Parent communication</span><h1>WhatsApp Communication</h1><p>Open verified click-to-WhatsApp conversations now; automated delivery remains disabled until a provider is configured.</p></div></header>
<div class="module-grid module-grid--2"><section class="module-card"><div class="module-card__header"><div><h2>Open WhatsApp</h2><p>Pakistani mobile numbers are normalized to 92 format.</p></div></div><form class="module-card__body module-form" method="post" action="<?= url('/admin/whatsapp/open') ?>" target="_blank"><?= csrf_field() ?><div class="module-field"><label>Mobile number</label><input class="module-input" name="phone" placeholder="03001234567" required></div><div class="module-field"><label>Message</label><textarea class="module-input" name="message" rows="6" required></textarea></div><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit"><i data-lucide="message-circle"></i> Open WhatsApp</button></form></section>
<section class="module-card"><div class="module-card__header"><div><h2>Message template</h2><p>Placeholders are text-only and cannot execute code.</p></div></div><form class="module-card__body module-form" method="post" action="<?= url('/admin/whatsapp/templates') ?>"><?= csrf_field() ?><div class="module-grid module-grid--2"><div class="module-field"><label>Template key</label><input class="module-input" name="event_key" placeholder="fee_due_reminder" pattern="[a-z0-9_]{3,60}" required></div><div class="module-field"><label>Display name</label><input class="module-input" name="name" placeholder="Fee Due Reminder" required></div></div><div class="module-field"><label>Template message</label><textarea class="module-input" name="body" rows="6" placeholder="Dear parent, {{student_name}} has {{amount_due}} outstanding." required></textarea><small>Supported context placeholders include student, class, invoice, fee, attendance, test and exam values.</small></div><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Save template</button></form></section></div>
<section class="module-card"><div class="module-card__header"><div><h2>Saved templates</h2><p><?= count($templates) ?> active template(s)</p></div></div><div class="table-scroll"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Event</th><th>Message</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php if(!$templates):?><tr><td colspan="4"><div class="compact-empty"><h3>No templates yet</h3><p>Add a reusable message for parent communication.</p></div></td></tr><?php else:foreach($templates as $t):?><tr><td><strong><?= e($t['name']) ?></strong></td><td><code><?= e($t['event_key']) ?></code></td><td><?= e($t['body']) ?></td><td><span class="student-status student-status--active">Active</span></td></tr><?php endforeach;endif?></tbody></table></div></section>
</div></div></main>
